03A feature families include phenology/curve shape, 2025-vs-history anomalies,
cross-sensor agreement, thermal-time proxies, rainfall timing, WaPOR water-productivity
proxies, soil-profile/nonlinear terms, cross-domain interactions and a small set of log basis
transforms. Read `docs/AGRONOMIC_FEATURES_V1.md` before changing them.

