The short-baseline NDVI condition features are explicitly VCI-like rather than standard VCI.
The historical reference is only 2022–2024. One Landsat VI6T historical-range exceedance
candidate was constant and dropped. The fold-local expression miner has 24 configured primitive
variables and may use yield only inside each training fold. Read `docs/EMPIRICAL_FEATURES_V1.md`.

